			"notes": "# v2.3.0 Changelog\n\n## New Features\n\n### TM/TR Cases & TM Machine\n\nNew storage items for organizing your move collection.\n\n**TM Case & TR Case**\n- Store all your TMs (1 each) or TRs (stackable) in a single portable item\n- Personal storage like an ender chest - your items persist even if the case is lost or destroyed\n- Tooltip tracks your collection progress (e.g., \"127/Pokemon TMs stored\")\n\n**TM Machine**\n- Placeable block with shared storage accessible by all players\n- Combines TM and TR storage in one interface\n- Works like a regular chest - items belong to whoever takes them\n\n**Shared UI Features**\n- Ghost previews of all available moves so you can see what's missing at a glance\n- Search by move name, or use tags like `#fire`, `#physical`, `#special`\n- Filter toggle: switch between All / Stored / Missing views\n- Pokémon filter: show only moves a specific Pokémon can learn\n  - Shift+click the filter button to select from your party\n  - Or use the case directly on one of your Pokémon, or shift use the TM/TR case item to select.\n  - Your last selected Pokémon stays available as a quick filter option\n  \n## Other Changes\n- Loot tables now use injection for better mod compatibility (Cobblemon, PokeLoot, Cobblemon Additions)\n- Removed unavailable moves: Shed Tail, Night Daze, V-create\n- Added translations: German, Spanish, French, Korean, Brazilian Portuguese, Simplified Chinese\n- Recycling recipes added: Craft any 4 TMs together (2×2) to get a Blank TM. Same for TRs. Useful for clearing out duplicates or unwanted moves."
		},
