			"notes": "# Changelog – Version 2.2.0\n\n- Updated for Cobblemon 1.7.\n- Removed Signature Move TMs.\n- Improved TM/TR tooltips by adding wrapped move descriptions so long text no longer extends off-screen.\n- Added four new config options (all `false` by default):\n  - `legacyMovesLearnable` – allows teaching legacy learnset moves. (introduced in cobblemon 1.7)\n  - `specialMovesLearnable` – allows teaching special learnset moves. (introduced in cobblemon 1.7)\n  - `dropFromLegacyMoveList` – enables legacy moves to drop from Pokémon.\n  - `dropFromSpecialMoveList` – enables special moves to drop from Pokémon."
